 r"I am writing to apply for the Associate Consultant -- Graduate Programme at Proxima. I completed an MSc in Health Data Science at University College London in September 2026, where a distinction is expected, after a BSc in Biological Sciences at Imperial College London, and I currently work as a Data Analyst Intern at TikTok Shop UK. Across my academic and professional experience I have built fact bases from messy data, compared options against clear criteria, and turned the results into recommendations that clients and colleagues act on.",

 r"What attracts me most to Proxima is that the work has a visible end point: measurable cost, capability and sustainability improvements that clients can see in their results, not just recommendations in a report. I like that Proxima's consultants work side by side with clients and take responsibility for delivery, and that as part of Bain \& Company it works with some of the largest organisations across many sectors. I enjoy taking an unclear business problem, identifying what users actually need, and turning it into a workflow that can be tested and improved.",

 r"At TikTok Shop UK I analyse merchant and transaction data in SQL and Python and build the KPI frameworks and dashboards that operations, product and commercial teams use to set targets and track initiatives. When my supervisor asked me to configure a merchant campaign by hand, I worked out the logic after a few examples and used Claude Code to build an AI agent with a validation step to check its accuracy, which cut the time the task took by around 40 to 50 percent. This taught me that a change only creates value once the people using it trust it, which I think is central to delivering real outcomes for clients.",

 r"At DS Digital Technology I worked as a Data Scientist Intern for a pharmaceutical client building a patient-facing AI service. I worked with the client's clinical experts to define what good looked like in a 246-question benchmark and six-dimension scoring rubric, then compared six AI models across more than 2,400 scored responses. The client adopted the benchmark as its acceptance standard. The approach is close to evaluating suppliers: agree the criteria with stakeholders first, then compare the options fairly and present a clear recommendation.",

 r"At Ipsos Strategy3 I worked on consulting projects for healthcare clients, building market-sizing and forecasting models and turning more than 80 expert interviews into structured data for client presentations. My MSc dissertation, using data from 458,840 UK Biobank participants, strengthened my analytical skills and my habit of checking that a result holds up before presenting it.",

 r"I would bring Proxima strong analytical and Excel skills, experience of client-facing consulting work, a structured approach to building fact bases and comparing options, and the ability to communicate findings clearly. I have the right to work in the UK until January 2029 without sponsorship, and I am based in London and happy to travel to client sites.",

